This Terraform program creates a basic AWS CodeBuild project with an associated IAM role. The IAM role allows the CodeBuild project to assume the role, which is necessary for the project to access AWS services. The CodeBuild project is configured to use GitHub as the source, store artifacts in an S3 bucket, and run on a Linux container using the AWS CodeBuild standard image. The cache is also configured to store build artifacts in another S3 bucket.

