This Terraform program creates an S3 bucket to store autograder results and a CodeBuild project to run students' code from GitHub. It also sets up an IAM role for the CodeBuild service to assume and attach a policy. The S3 bucket has a private ACL and is tagged for easy identification. The CodeBuild project uses a standard Linux container image, assumes the CodeBuild service role, and sources code from a GitHub repository. The VPC configuration includes security groups and subnets.

