This Terraform program creates an S3 bucket and a CloudFront distribution to serve video content globally. The S3 bucket is configured with basic CORS rules, and the CloudFront distribution is set up to use the S3 bucket as its origin. The distribution is configured to allow all methods and protocols, and it uses ACM certificates for SSL/TLS encryption. The program includes default tags for both the S3 bucket and the CloudFront distribution.

